/target
# Cargo.lock is intentionally committed: web-search ships a binary ([[bin]]) and
# is installed via `cargo install`, so a pinned, reproducible dependency graph is
# required. Leaving it unpinned let a freshly published `alloc-no-stdlib 3.0.0`
# break the `brotli` encoder build on fresh CI resolution (issue #15) even though
# no source changed. See docs/case-studies/issue-15.
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb
